import VOA.DeligneAudit.E8CarrierTables
import VOA.DeligneAudit.E8LieTable

/-!
# `E₈` relation propagation steps (generated)

The 3875 relations of `E8CarrierTables` were generated by BFS from the highest-weight relation `0` under
the lowering derivations `ad F_i`.  `stepOf s = (p, f, g)` records the BFS edge: `ad x_f (P_p) = g · P_s`
with `p < s` (exact, by construction; re-checked in Lean by `stepOK`, `E8VacuumStepCheck*`).
`dQuad f P` is the derivation `ad x_f` on a sparse quadratic list (cert structure constants `E8Lie.sL`).
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false
set_option maxRecDepth 100000

